m the re-implemented SonoWorld (analyzed below), the best FAD and IB, while decomposing audio into per-object sources rather than generating a single scene-level waveform. CLAP and IB score the mixture rendered at each viewpoint against the scene-level query. The binaural statistics ( 1 − 1{-} IACC, ILD) confirm that every spatial method produces interaural cues; beyond that", "stderr": "", "interrupted": false, "isImage": false, "noOutputExpected": false}}
